{{- if model.processes.size > 0 }}

## Processes

| Process | Domain | Use | Subject | States | Scenarios |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
{{- for p in model.processes }}
| [{{ md_cell p.display_name }}](processes/{{ kebab p.name }}.md) | {{ p.package ? (md_code p.package.qualified_name) : "" }} | {{ p.use }} | {{ p.subject ? (md_code p.subject.name) : "" }} | {{ p.all_states.size }} | {{ p.scenarios.size }} |
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
